  "discord": "ARC2 Early edition: Nguyen reaches thirtieth after adding nearly four points overnight; Tatu Helander climbs eleven places. Tufa holds the lead. The delayed issue preserves the scheduled morning standings and explains Kaggle’s guidance for queued final submissions. https://arc.markbarney.net/news/2026-10-27-morning-arc-2",
